rooms_desc ({"As you enter you feel as though you have entered a differentworld.  One made up of crystal and ice.  Along the cieling you see long icy stlagtites,which drip into icy pools in thefloor.  The room sparkles when the light hits it just right.You feel very relaxed here.  In the center of the room is a snow white couch. With a white bear skin rug in front of it.","       In this room you see a huge crystal sitting high atop an ice tower.  When you gaze at the crystalyou feel you are in touch with your inner self. There are no secrets here. Stay or leave, but be warned,the real youmight not be what you want to see.","This room is for Icelady's special someone. Here someone can sit,rest,read a book,or just relax.  There is a double bay windowoverlooking many miles of hills and lush green mountains.  There is a king sized easy chair here to relax in and a cooler full of tall cold ones for him.So enjoy my friend as you are always welcome here.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is icelady's playroom. In here you can act like a kid and it dosen't matter.  The room has a huge pile of kingsized pillows and a sectional all grouped togetherto form massive play area.  HAVE FUN AALL WHO ENTER HERE.",0,0,})
